# Cloudflare Workers Assets: request rewrites.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/
#
# Format: [source] [destination] [status]
#
# Hard-404 the whole /dev/ tree. The pages exist in dist/ so we can
# iterate on them locally (via WG on the VF hardware), but public
# visitors get a 404 regardless of noindex meta or robots.txt.
# Belt-and-braces with robots.txt Disallow: /dev/ and per-page noindex.

/dev/*      /404.html   404
